// ============ JALUR CYBER SECURITY (HACKER ETIS) — bagian 1: tahap 1–3 ============
// Kurikulum disusun dari silabus publik: MIT 6.5660 Computer Systems Security & 6.1600 Foundations of
// Computer Security, Harvard CS50's Introduction to Cybersecurity, Oxford Computer Security & MSc
// Software and Systems Security, ditambah OWASP Top 10:2025 dan NIST SP 800-63B Rev. 4.
